    "histoire": {
      "type": "section",
      "name": "Notre histoire",
      "blocks": {
        "image": {
          "type": "image",
          "name": "Photo",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bracelet-trefle-toutes-couleurs.jpg",
            "image_ratio": "portrait",
            "width": "fill",
            "border_radius": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "texte": {
          "type": "group",
          "name": "Texte",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "vertical_on_mobile": true,
            "gap": 18,
            "horizontal_alignment": "flex-start",
            "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start",
            "vertical_alignment": "center",
            "vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column": "center",
            "width": "fill",
            "height": "fit",
            "padding-inline-start": 24,
            "padding-inline-end": 24
          },
          "blocks": {
            "eyebrow": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "Sur-titre",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Notre histoire</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "0.75rem",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "loose",
                "case": "uppercase",
                "wrap": "pretty"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "title": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "Titre",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h2>Des bijoux pensés comme des porte-bonheur</h2>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "h2",
                "font": "var(--font-primary--family)",
                "font_size": "",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "wrap": "pretty"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "p1": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "Paragraphe 1",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Tout a commencé par une conviction simple : un beau bijou ne devrait pas être réservé aux grandes occasions. Il devrait se porter tous les jours, accompagner les petits moments comme les grands, et devenir peu à peu une part de soi.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "narrow",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "paragraph",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "wrap": "pretty"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "p2": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "Paragraphe 2",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Nous avons choisi le trèfle, symbole universel de chance, et l’avons décliné en sept couleurs pour que chacune et chacun trouve celui qui lui ressemble. Des pièces légères et lumineuses, pensées pour être portées seules ou accumulées.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "narrow",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "paragraph",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "wrap": "pretty"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "p3": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "Paragraphe 3",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Chaque bijou est sélectionné avec soin, présenté avec simplicité et expédié avec un numéro de suivi. Notre promesse : vous offrir l’élégance au quotidien, à un prix juste.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "narrow",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "paragraph",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "wrap": "pretty"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "cta": {
              "type": "button",
              "name": "Bouton",
              "settings": {
                "label": "Découvrir tous nos bijoux",
                "link": "shopify://collections/all",
                "style_class": "button-secondary"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "eyebrow",
            "title",
            "p1",
            "p2",
            "p3",
            "cta"
          ]
        }
      },
